      <description>&lt;section class="notes"&gt;
    &lt;h2&gt;What's new in 0.8&lt;/h2&gt;
    &lt;ul class="points"&gt;
      &lt;li&gt;Heliograph is now Heliogram.&lt;/li&gt;
      &lt;li&gt;Kiosk, for lobbies and classrooms, is now a subscription from the Mac
          App Store, monthly or yearly, with the first month free, in two tiers: Kiosk, and a lower-priced Kiosk with
          Store that keeps the My Heliogram link on screen. Macs already running
          Kiosk keep it.&lt;/li&gt;
      &lt;li&gt;Heliogram is coming to the Mac App Store.&lt;/li&gt;
      &lt;li&gt;Help &amp;gt; Copy Diagnostics copies a short report to paste into a
          support email, with your home folder hidden.&lt;/li&gt;
      &lt;li&gt;A clip with no readable time is captioned UNKNOWN.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;/ul&gt;
  &lt;/section&gt;</description>
